flowchart TD
    Start([Deploy: deploy-site.sh]) --> Pull[git pull --ff-only]
    Pull -->|pull failed - local drift| Stop1[STOP - resolve local changes / stash / reset]
    Pull --> Copy[Copy web/ to /var/www/hello-web]
    Copy --> Chown[chown -R webuser:webuser web root]
    Chown --> Test{Nginx config test<br/>nginx -t}
    Test -->|FAIL| Fix[Fix config syntax / duplicate directives]
    Fix --> Test
    Test -->|PASS| Reload[systemctl reload nginx<br/>zero-downtime apply]
    Reload --> Smoke{Smoke test<br/>tests/smoke-test.sh}
    Smoke -->|PASS| Done([Deployment successful])
    Smoke -->|FAIL| Rollback[Rollback: git checkout previous-good-commit web/]
    Rollback --> Copy
    Stop1 --> End([Abort deployment])
